{"id": "22-5551-2-2", "zh": "以 ta 为首的词缀部", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5552-2-6", "zh": "以下讲述常规词形部。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-5553-2-25", "zh": "ta、ti、tu、tavantu、tāvī、tvā、tvāna、tuna、tuṃ、tave、tāye、tabba。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5554-2-39", "zh": "dā、khyā、gā、ghā、ṭā、ṭhā、tā、thā、dā、dhā、pā、phā、bhā、mā、yā、lā、vā、sā、hā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5555-2-9", "zh": "akkhāto、svākkhāto、ākhyāto、vikhyāto。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5556-2-17", "zh": "依“Ū byañjanassā”规则，有时加入 ī 增音并变为短音：saṅgāyito、ghāyito、ñāto。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5557-2-10", "zh": "依“Jyādīhi knā”规则加 nā 词缀：jānito。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5558-2-5", "zh": "使役形：ñāpito、ñāpayito。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5558-6-10", "zh": "保护、守护儿子，所以称为 tāto，也就是父亲。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5558-11-15", "zh": "datto：辅音叠用，并变为短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5558-16-25", "zh": "devadatto、brahmadatto、yaññadatto、dāpito、dāpayito。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5559-2-7", "zh": "依大规则，pā 变为 piva：pivo、pivito。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5560-2-7", "zh": "phā 义为增长：phito，例如已经破晓的夜。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "22-5561-2-17", "zh": "mā 义为度量：mito、sammito、upamito、nimmito、yāto、lāto、vāto。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5562-2-26", "zh": "依大规则，vā 变为 u：nibbuto、parinibbuto、nibbāpito、parinibbāpito、osito、pariyosito、osāpito、pariyosāpito、pahito、pajahito、hāpito。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5563-2-13", "zh": "在 ti 词缀下：ñatti、datti、pāti、phāti、nibbuti、parinibbuti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5564-2-38", "zh": "在 tu 词缀下：saṅkhātā sabbadhammānaṃ（一切法的计数者）〔jā.2.22.1451〕，akkhātāro tathāgatā（如来们是宣说者）〔dha.pa.276〕，aññātāro bhavissanti（他们将成为了知者）〔dī.ni.2.68〕，ñāpetā、ñāpayitā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5564-39-51", "zh": "Uṭṭhātā vindate dhanaṃ（勤奋的人获得财富）〔saṃ.ni.1.246〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5565-2-40", "zh": "依“Ū lasse”规则，有时 ī 变为 e：uṭṭhāpetā、samuṭṭhāpetā，aghassa tātā（苦难的救护者），tāyitā、dātā、dāpetā、sandhātā、sandhāpetā、māpitā、māpayitā、nibbāpetā、nibbāpayitā、hāpetā、hāpayitā。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-5566-2-8", "zh": "在 tavantu、tāvī 词缀下：akkhatā、akkhātāvī 等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5567-2-15", "zh": "在 tvā 等词缀下，遇到复辅音时变为短音：ñatvā、jānitvā、ñāpetvā、jānāpetvā、ṭhatvā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5568-2-9", "zh": "在 pa 等前缀之后，ṭhā 变为 ṭhaha：saṇṭhahitvā、patiṭṭhahitvā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5569-2-19", "zh": "使役形有时变为短音：ṭhapetvā、paṭṭhapetvā、patiṭṭhāpetvā、datvā、ādiyitvā、samādiyitvā、dajjitvā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5570-2-18", "zh": "dada 义为给予：tvā 变为 ya，ya 之前的 d 变为 j，y 同化为前一个音，元音变长：dajjā、dāpetvā。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-5571-2-6", "zh": "在 pa 等前缀之后变为短音：samādapetvā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5572-2-32", "zh": "dhā 义为执持：词根叠用，前一个音变为第三类辅音并变为短音，后一个音依“dhāssa ho”规则变为 ho：padahitvā、vidahitvā、nidahitvā、saddahitvā、odahitvā、pidahitvā、paridahitvā。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-5573-2-26", "zh": "使役形：ādhapetvā、sannidhāpetvā；pivitvā，或者 pitvā；pāyetvā、māpetvā、osāpetvā、pariyosāpetvā、hitvā、pajahitvā、hāpetvā、pajahāpetvā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5574-2-141", "zh": "在 tuṃ、tave 词缀下：akkhātuṃ、akkhātave、saṅkhātuṃ、saṅkhātave、ñātuṃ、ñātave、jānituṃ、jānitave、ñāpetuṃ、ñāpetave、jānāpetuṃ、jānāpetave、ṭhātuṃ、ṭhātave、saṇṭhātuṃ、saṇṭhātave、saṇṭhahituṃ、saṇṭhahitave、ṭhapetuṃ、ṭhapetave、saṇṭhāpetuṃ、saṇṭhāpetave、dātuṃ、dātave、padātuṃ、padātave、ādātuṃ、ādātave、dajjituṃ、dajjitave、dāpetuṃ、dāpetave、samādapetuṃ、samādapetave、sandhātuṃ、sandhātave、saddahituṃ、saddahetuṃ、saddahetave、nidhetuṃ、nidhetave、sandhāpetuṃ、nidhāpetuṃ、pātuṃ、pivituṃ、pātave、pivetave、mātuṃ、minituṃ、pametuṃ、upametuṃ、yātuṃ、yāyituṃ、yātave、osāyetuṃ、osāpetuṃ、pariyosāpetuṃ、hātuṃ、pahātuṃ，māradheyyaṃ pahātave（为了舍弃魔的领域）〔dha.pa.34〕，jahituṃ、pajahituṃ、hāpetuṃ、pahāpetuṃ、jahāpetuṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5575-2-49", "zh": "在 tabba 词缀下：akkhātabbaṃ、saṅkhātabbaṃ、saṅkhyātabbaṃ、gāyitabbaṃ、ñātabbaṃ、jānitabbaṃ、ñāpetabbaṃ、jānāpetabbaṃ、ṭhātabbaṃ、ṭhapetabbaṃ、dātabbaṃ、ādātabbaṃ、samādātabbaṃ、dāpetabbaṃ、samādapetabbaṃ、vidhātabbaṃ、vidahitabbaṃ、pātabbaṃ、pivitabbaṃ、minitabbaṃ、minetabbaṃ、yātabbaṃ、lātabbaṃ、pahātabbaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5576-2-25", "zh": "在以 i、ī 结尾的词根中：带 vi 前缀的 i 义为行走：vīto，例如 vītadoso vītamoho（离瞋、离痴）〔saṃ.ni.1.249〕；udito、samudito，加入 d 增音。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-5577-2-52", "zh": "samito、sameto、samaveto、apeto、upeto、samupeto、abhito、kīto、kayito、kiṇito、cito、cinito、ācito、upacito、sañcito、jito、parājito、ḍito、oḍḍito、nīto、ānīto、vinīto、oṇīto、paṇīto，其中 n 变为 ṇ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5578-2-13", "zh": "pīto、bhīto、mito、sito、nissito、pahito。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5579-2-16", "zh": "在 ti 词缀下：samiti、viciti、nīti；辅音叠用时首音增强：netti、saddhammanetti、bhīti。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-5580-2-15", "zh": "在 tu 词缀下：sametā、abhisametā、vicetā、jetā、netā、vinetā、ninnetā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5581-2-12", "zh": "在 tavantu、tāvī 词缀下：sametavā、sametāvī、abhisametavā、abhisametāvī 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5582-2-37", "zh": "在 tvā 等词缀下：sametvā、upetvā、kiṇitvā、vicinitvā、jetvā、vijetvā、jinitvā、vijinitvā、parājetvā、netvā、ānetvā、vinetvā、nayitvā、ānayitvā、vinayitvā、allīyitvā、paṭisallīyitvā、sayitvā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5583-2-45", "zh": "在 tuṃ、tave 词缀下：sametuṃ、upetuṃ、samupetuṃ、sametave、ketuṃ、kiṇituṃ、ketave、vicetuṃ、vicinituṃ、jetuṃ、vijetuṃ、nituṃ、ānituṃ、vinituṃ、netuṃ、ānetuṃ、vinetuṃ、nayituṃ、ānayituṃ、vinayituṃ、netave。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5584-2-8", "zh": "在 tabba 词缀下：sametabbaṃ、ketabbaṃ、kiṇitabbaṃ 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5585-2-5", "zh": "在以 u、ū 结尾的词根中：cuto、cavito。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5586-2-3", "zh": "使役形：cāvito。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5587-2-11", "zh": "juto、javito、thuto、abhitthuto、abhitthavito，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5588-2-6", "zh": "带 saṃ 前缀的 dhu 义为亲爱：sandhuto，也就是朋友。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5588-7-15", "zh": "经文中也有“Asaṇṭhutaṃ cirasaṇṭhutena”（以久识者取代不相识者）的读法。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-5589-2-8", "zh": "du 义为行走以及伤害：duto、upadduto。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5590-2-7", "zh": "dhū 义为摇动：dhuto、niddhuto。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5591-2-5", "zh": "bhūto、sambhūto。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5592-2-9", "zh": "使役形：bhāvito、sambhāvito、vibhāvito、paribhāvito。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5593-2-5", "zh": "yu 义为混合：saṃyuto。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5594-2-17", "zh": "ru 义为发声：ruto、luto、vuto、saṃvuto、susaṃvuto、suto、vissuto。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5595-2-5", "zh": "hu 义为供奉：huto。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5596-2-14", "zh": "在 ti 词缀下：cavanaṃ（坠落）就是 cuti，thavanaṃ（称赞）就是 thuti，bhūti、vibhūti，savanaṃ（听闻）就是 suti，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5597-2-15", "zh": "在 tu 词缀下：cavitā、cāvetā、javitā、thavitā、santhavitā、sotā、sāvetā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5598-2-12", "zh": "在 tavantu、tāvī 词缀下：cutavā、cutāvī、cāvetavā、cāvetāvī 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5599-2-27", "zh": "在 tvā 等词缀下：cavitvā、cavitvāna、cavituna、javitvā、abhitthavitvā、bhutvā、anubhavitvā、bhāvetvā、bhāvayitvā、sutvā、suṇitvā、sāvetvā、sāvayitvā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5600-2-21", "zh": "在 tuṃ、tave 词缀下：cavituṃ、cāvetuṃ、bhotuṃ、bhavituṃ、anubhavituṃ、bhāvetuṃ、bhāvayituṃ、sotuṃ、sāvetuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5601-2-5", "zh": "hū 义为存在：hotuṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5601-6-21", "zh": "“Yā icche puriso hotuṃ（一个人想要成为怎样的人）〔jā.2.22.1282〕。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-5601-22-44", "zh": "Na so sakkā na hotuye（那就不可能不成为）”〔bu.vaṃ.2.9 作‘… hetuye’〕，这是经文中的用例。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-5602-2-11", "zh": "在 tabba 词缀下：cavitabbaṃ、bhavitabbaṃ、anubhavitabbaṃ、bhāvetabbaṃ、sotabbaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5602-12-15", "zh": "辅音叠用时：sottabbaṃ、sāvetabbaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5603-2-20", "zh": "在以 e 结尾的词根中，依大规则，有时 e 变为 i：gāyito、apacāyito，或者 apacito，ujjhāyito、nijjhāyito、abhijjhāyito。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-5604-2-7", "zh": "gāyanaṃ（歌唱）就是 gīti，apacāyanaṃ（恭敬）就是 apaciti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5605-2-7", "zh": "在 tu 词缀下：gāyitā、apacāyitā、ujjhāyitā。", "confidence": 85}
